Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是设计西西装置的设计初衷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what Sissy was designed to do.
