Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们刚好发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe we're just discovering
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它真正的功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what it actually does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一个猝不及防的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unintended reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们认为可以将时间减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we thought we were slowing time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但实际上我们让它循环了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what if we looped it instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说你卡在今天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're stuck in this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便提醒你  你会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and by the way, you're gonna die
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍地死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}again and again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,卡特  告诉你女朋友不要再来吓我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carter, tell your girlfriend to stop trying to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她不算我女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she's not my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等  你是我女朋友吗  -算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, wait, are you my girlfriend? - Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能暂时放下你们之间的关系问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are you done talking about your relationship status?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她刚刚说了我会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she just said I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,而你得尽快找办法去停止时间循环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need to figure out how to close the loop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不然那个杀手会再次杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the killer finds you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.69,0:14:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不知道发生了什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't know how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个设备就自己运行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just fired on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,丹妮尔  你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danielle. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-你去哪里了  -什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where were you? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你没参加我们的寝室会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ditched our house meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是取消了吗  -什么时候的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was canceled. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在我把杀人的室友踢出窗外之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, after I kicked my murdering roommate out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  是谁天天向卡帕祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. Who's gonna pledge Kappa
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,说我们中了死亡诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now that we have a death curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还说我们现在很危险  翠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in crisis mode, Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  我是  我是萨玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm- I'm- I'm Samar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  萨莫萨  眼睛看哪里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Samosa, my head's the middle one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样  在你们的诡异会谈弄完之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyhoo, call me as soon as you're done
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,尽快给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your creepy little Comic-Con meeting. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚刚叫我"萨莫萨"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she just call me "samosa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-你觉得她喜欢萨莫萨吗  -不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think she likes samosas? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  别分心  我还不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, focus. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,乐观点来说  你会复活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the bright side, you'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了11次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I died 11 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,11次吗  他奶奶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11? Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-被杀很疼的  -等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That shit hurts. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要找个最安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need to find the safest possible place
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在那里等杀手不就行了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wait it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,人山人海的地方不就挺安全的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's... safety in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还不如说是躲在众目睽睽之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like hiding in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个鬼才选的诡异娃娃脸面具来当吉祥物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who picks a creepy baby for a mascot anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道就去麻省理工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I should have gone to M.I.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他走步违规了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He traveled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,三不沾喽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你和你妈妈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you and your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太有爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这太讽刺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想  因为某些莫名其妙的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I thought I was stuck in the same day
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我困在同一天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some big cosmic reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.83,0:17:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  面对妈妈的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, facing my mom's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,却无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had nothing to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,结果却发现这只是一个科学的意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out it was just some big scientific fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但这并没有失去它的意义  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make it mean any less, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你那里沾了点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you got a little something right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, uh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你这太老套了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但你还是上当了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you fell for it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请大家从最近的出口离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please make your way to the nearest exit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,保持好秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,请大家从最近的出口离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please make your way to the nearest exit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,保持好秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,重复  这不是演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again, this is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别推我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  我找不到手机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I can't find my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,救我  帮帮我  求求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.87,0:20:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么人  -来下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that? - Down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害啊  做的不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, damn. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-我之前可是练过的  -搞什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a little practice. - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你是凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你该出声说句话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那  这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你  你没有双胞胎兄弟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you... you don't have a twin brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你们出生的时候就被分开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you were separated at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  我很确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-见鬼  -确实是"见鬼"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit. - "Oh, shit" is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我是谁  呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you think I am, dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-废话  -废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Duh. - Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我在试图关闭时间循环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I was trying to close the loop,
