Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.80,1:06:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你惊人的记忆力  应该用不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to your crazy memory, it shouldn't take long at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.67,1:06:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,几分钟后就可以让西西装置准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have Sissy ready to go in just a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.61,1:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要一点点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.45,1:06:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有些事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.28,1:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,翠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.69,1:07:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定要回去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you want to go back?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.96,1:07:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,总不能一辈子活在过去里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't spend my life living in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.63,1:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要有点信心放手一搏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to take a leap of faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.44,1:07:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可算回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She finally rolls in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.57,1:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,罗丽  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lori, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.91,1:07:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚很忙吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big night?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.91,1:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  罗丽  我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, look, Lori, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.39,1:07:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.35,1:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wha...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.96,1:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很开心能见到你  翠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you, too, Tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.63,1:07:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他不值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.34,1:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.01,1:07:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我也曾和一个已婚男人有一腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been involved with a married guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.71,1:08:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也清楚以双重身份生活是什么滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it's like living a double life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.08,1:08:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,总是觉得自己很差劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always feeling like shit about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.62,1:08:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是浪子回头金不换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's never too late to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.45,1:08:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有人和我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone once told me that
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.86,1:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"每一天都是一个让自己更优秀的机会"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"every day is a chance to be someone better."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.89,1:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,或许今天就是你变得更优秀的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this is your day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.63,1:08:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.85,1:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.83,1:08:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,翠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.73,1:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.60,1:09:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  丹妮尔  我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... look, Danielle, I feel really bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.68,1:09:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,之前一直误会你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've totally been misjudging you,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's completely on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.15,1:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-我很抱歉  我想把  -赞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am so sorry that I've, like, made this... - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.05,1:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,三人行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three-way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.82,1:09:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他开玩笑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.42,1:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我没开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm-I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.52,1:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克的  呃  花洒坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick's, um, shower was broken,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.52,1:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我让他借用我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I said he could use mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.43,1:09:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧  尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.00,1:09:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的花洒好着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My shower's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.56,1:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那个  当我没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Um, you know what? Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.10,1:09:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.44,1:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-ee.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.18,1:09:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,打我干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.91,1:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你蠢得跟石头一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For being dumb as a rock. That's what.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.78,1:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  是吗  石头怎么会蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really? How can a rock be dumb?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.75,1:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们连脑子都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't even have brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.77,1:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个女寿星到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the other birthday girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.84,1:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好啊  亲爱的  -你好  老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Hi, sweetie. - Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.11,1:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我和妈妈单独聊两句吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, do you mind if I talk to Mom alone for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.58,1:10:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是些女孩间的私房话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just some girl talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.91,1:10:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Well, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.55,1:10:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那我去打几个工作电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I can go run some work calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.68,1:10:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.99,1:10:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.15,1:10:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.72,1:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.76,1:10:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕  我要怎么开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit, how do I do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.70,1:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么  亲爱的  怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what, sweetie? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.80,1:10:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.74,1:10:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我真想让你知道我有多爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really want you to know how much I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.74,1:10:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也好爱你  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.18,1:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  妈妈  我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mom, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.95,1:10:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,人们总是说 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, people say "I love you"
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.85,1:11:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the time, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.19,1:11:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在你无法再次当面说出这句话的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not until you can't say it to that person's face anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才会发现自己有多深爱着对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you really realize how much you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你如此完美又如此漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so beautiful and so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.18,1:11:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just hope I can become
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.14,1:11:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我能有你一半的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}half of the woman that you are one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.18,1:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在说笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.55,1:11:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有了你  我才变成了现在的自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the woman I am because I had you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.62,1:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这话我还从没对其他人说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I never really told anyone this before,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.26,1:11:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,当我怀上你的时候  我吓得手足无措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when I was pregnant with you, I was scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.86,1:11:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.90,1:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但当我抱着你的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, the moment I held you,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.00,1:11:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我内心的某些部分就立刻改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something inside of me changed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.24,1:11:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,最伟大的爱就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best kind of love does that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.77,1:11:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,它会改变你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It changes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.84,1:11:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,使你成为一个更好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes you a better person.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.35,1:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  我太笨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.89,1:12:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的以为我可以拥有一切  但我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really thought I could have it all, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.96,1:12:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的  没人可以拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey, nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.16,1:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你猜怎么着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But guess what.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.73,1:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.93,1:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你会得到你需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get what you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.36,1:12:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.13,1:12:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.88,1:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我压着你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I crushing you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.38,1:12:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.85,1:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远是我的小女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always gonna be my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.05,1:12:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你生日快乐 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.89,1:12:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你生日快乐 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.33,1:12:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 祝翠和妈妈生日快乐 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Happy birthday, Tree and Mom
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.03,1:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你生日快乐 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.24,1:13:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,许个愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.13,1:13:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.74,1:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.24,1:13:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这可能非常令人困惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is probably pretty confusing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.38,1:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  你们认识我才几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you guys have only known me for a couple hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.15,1:13:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但我已经认识你们几个星期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've known you for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.39,1:13:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都很努力地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've all worked really, really hard
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.89,1:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,试图帮我送回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to try to send me home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.69,1:13:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So thank you.
