Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.42,1:32:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活将去向何方  谁懂哥的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Life goin' nowhere. Somebody help me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.09,1:32:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有谁懂哥的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Somebody help me, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.33,1:32:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我只想痛快地活着 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm stayin' alive ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.10,1:32:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活将去向何方 谁懂哥的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Life goin' nowhere. Somebody help me, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.87,1:32:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有谁能懂哥的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Somebody help me, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.47,1:32:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有谁能懂哥的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Somebody help me, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.91,1:33:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活将去向何方  谁懂哥深沉的寂寞 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Life goin' nowhere. Somebody help me, yeah. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.92,1:33:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.15,1:33:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.19,1:33:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像个弹弓似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It acted like a slingshot.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.99,1:33:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当她跳回这个维度时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she jumped back into this dimension,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.46,1:33:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,向心力产生的真空会使时间循环闭合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the vacuum created by the centripetal force closed the loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.96,1:33:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谁这么造孽把这么完好的小油条扔地上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who throws away a perfectly good churro?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.43,1:33:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,噢你别  别吃啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.61,1:33:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦  看上去有点不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh. This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.44,1:33:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是瑞恩 凡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ryan Phan?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.88,1:33:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  好像是我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.28,1:33:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是艾萨克·帕克博士  代表美国国防高级研究计划局(DARPA)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Isaac Parker. I'm here on behalf of DARPA.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.28,1:33:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.62,1:33:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能配合我们进行一些调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd appreciate it if you'd come with us
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.62,1:33:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将不胜感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to answer some questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.52,1:33:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.66,1:33:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们惹了什么麻烦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.46,1:33:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.94,1:34:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,卡利巴托博士请到人工智能区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Kalibato to Robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.39,1:34:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,卡利巴托博士请到人工智能区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Kalibato to Robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.59,1:34:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,卧了个大槽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.22,1:34:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,西西装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sissy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.56,1:34:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你们不介意我们征用了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you don't mind us borrowing her.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.49,1:34:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这里的所作所为令人叹为观止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you've created here is truly remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.23,1:34:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一边玩去吧  布洛森院长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck it, Dean Bronson.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.36,1:34:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在研究这个装置时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been having some difficulties
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.67,1:34:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到了一些困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}understanding how the device operates.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.10,1:34:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你们能帮上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We figured you could help.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.14,1:34:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有很多不同的算法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many different algorithms.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.27,1:34:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很难找到合适的方法能让它稳定发挥作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be tough to find the right one to make it work.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.11,1:34:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许能帮上忙哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to help with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.31,1:34:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.51,1:34:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  我们只缺一个测试对象了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we just need to find a test subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.45,1:34:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你们是想把人困在时间循环里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you... you want to trap somebody in a time loop?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.45,1:34:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这太扯淡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.35,1:34:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当然除非有人活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.26,1:34:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到了个完美的候选人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I have the perfect recruit.
